### Use VS Code "REST Client" extension (or import into Postman)
@base = http://localhost:8080/api/tasks

### Add task
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Finish assignment", "description": "Spring Boot project", "deadline": "2026-10-30", "priority": "HIGH" }

### Empty title -> 400 error
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "" }

### View all
GET {{base}}

### Pending only
GET {{base}}?status=PENDING

### Completed only
GET {{base}}?status=COMPLETED

### Search
GET {{base}}?search=assign

### Get one
GET {{base}}/1

### Update
PUT {{base}}/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Finish assignment (edited)", "description": "Add tests", "deadline": "2026-11-02", "priority": "MEDIUM", "status": "PENDING" }

### Mark completed
PATCH {{base}}/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "COMPLETED" }

### Delete
DELETE {{base}}/1
